ave quite a  few diversity initiatives please come to  our go to our website and learn more  about those we have a diversity and  scientific computing mailing list that  we invite you all to join and be able to  use that for for communication and last  but not least please go to none focus  org check out our membership we have  free community membership anyone can  join receive our newsletter get project  updates on what's going on with the with  the community with PI data and we also  invite you to check out our supporting  membership which you may do so at any  any level and everything is appreciated  so hopefully you have a little better  understanding of what we do and we  invite you to be a part of it thank you  you
 

